   ],
   "id": "titanic-032"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 3) Data Quality Assessment"
   ],
   "id": "titanic-033"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3.1) Missing Values\n",
