   "source": [
    "### Interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "Cabin information is available for 204 passengers and missing for 687. Missing text does not mean the passenger had no cabin."
   ],
   "id": "titanic-070"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4.7) Shared Tickets\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective:** Count ticket occurrences and attach the count using a left merge."
   ],
   "id": "titanic-071"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "ticket_counts = (\n",
    "    df_clean.groupby(\"Ticket\", as_index=False)\n",
    "    .agg(TicketGroupSize=(\"PassengerId\", \"size\"))\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "df_clean = df_clean.merge(\n",
    "    ticket_counts, on=\"Ticket\", how=\"left\", validate=\"many_to_one\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "df_clean[\"Ticket_Type\"] = \"Unique ticket\"\n",
    "df_clean.loc[df_clean[\"TicketGroupSize\"] > 1, \"Ticket_Type\"] = \"Shared ticket\"\n",
    "\n",
    "df_clean[[\"Ticket\", \"TicketGroupSize\", \"Ticket_Type\"]].head()"
   ],
   "execution_count": 22,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": [
      "             Ticket  TicketGroupSize    Ticket_Type\n",
      "0         A/5 21171                1  Unique ticket\n",
      "1          PC 17599                1  Unique ticket\n",
      "2  STON/O2. 3101282                1  Unique ticket\n",
      "3            113803                2  Shared ticket\n",
      "4            373450                1  Unique ticket\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "id": "titanic-072"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Code Explanation\n",
    "\n",
    "`groupby()` builds a ticket-level lookup. `merge(..., how=\"left\")` adds it to the passenger-level table. `validate=\"many_to_one\"` checks that each ticket has only one lookup row, preventing accidental row multiplication."
   ],
   "id": "titanic-073"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "The left merge retains passenger rows and adds one count per ticket. A shared ticket occurs more than once in this dataset. The sample does not necessarily include everyone who used that ticket."
   ],
   "id": "titanic-074"
  },
  {
