  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 5) Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Understand the passenger population before comparing survival rates."
   ],
   "id": "titanic-081"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
